# `setp.lt.u32` compares unsigned. ptxas runs the first store on threads
# 16 to 47, %tid.x - 16 wrapping below 16: an unsigned comparison of an
# operand that may be negative is read as signed, 0 <= %tid.x - 16 and
# %tid.x - 16 < 32, the CTA's 32 threads and 128 B. It runs the second
# on the threads with %tid.x mod 16 == 0, %tid.x << 28 wrapping above
# 15, read as its low 32 bits, 2^28·(%tid.x mod 16): lanes 0 and 16 of
# each warp, 16 B. The third swaps
# the first's operands, `hi`, and runs on the same threads; the fourth
# reads %tid.x - 64, in [-64, 0), as 2^32 - 64 + %tid.x, at or above
# 0xffffffe0 on threads 32 to 63.
RUN: %ptxroof analyze %fixtures/micro/setp_unsigned.ptx | FileCheck --check-prefix=ANN "%s"
ANN: {{^}}.visible .entry micro_setp_unsigned( // block 64×1×1 | pointer params assumed 32 B aligned | per CTA: global store 128 B; param load 512 B{{$}}
ANN: {{^}}	@%p1 st.global.u32 	[%rd3], %r1; // warp 0 × lane 16-31 ∪ warp 1 × lane 0-15 | exec 32/CTA | global store [4·%tid.x + param_0] sectors/req 2 (ideal 2){{$}}
ANN: {{^}}.visible .entry micro_setp_unsigned_wraps( // block 64×1×1 | pointer params assumed 32 B aligned | per CTA: global store 16 B; param load 512 B{{$}}
ANN: {{^}}	@%p1 st.global.u32 	[%rd3], %r1; // warp * × lane 0,16 | exec 4/CTA | global store [4·%tid.x + param_0] sectors/req 2 (ideal 1){{$}}
ANN: {{^}}.visible .entry micro_setp_unsigned_hi( // block 64×1×1 | pointer params assumed 32 B aligned | per CTA: global store 128 B; param load 512 B{{$}}
ANN: {{^}}	@%p1 st.global.u32 	[%rd3], %r1; // warp 0 × lane 16-31 ∪ warp 1 × lane 0-15 | exec 32/CTA | global store [4·%tid.x + param_0] sectors/req 2 (ideal 2){{$}}
ANN: {{^}}.visible .entry micro_setp_unsigned_hs( // block 64×1×1 | pointer params assumed 32 B aligned | per CTA: global store 128 B; param load 512 B{{$}}
ANN: {{^}}	@%p1 st.global.u32 	[%rd3], %r1; // warp 1 × lane * | exec 32/CTA | global store [4·%tid.x + param_0] sectors/req 4 (ideal 4){{$}}
